msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Libretro compatibility layer for Kodi's Game API"
msgstr "Ciseal comhoiriúnachta Libretro le haghaidh API Cluiche Kodi"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "This add-on provides a wrapper for libretro cores, allowing them to be loaded as game add-ons."
msgstr "Cuireann an breiseán seo fillteán ar fáil do chroíleacáin libretro, rud a ligeann dóibh a luchtú mar bhreiseáin cluiche."

msgctxt "#30000"
msgid "Crop overscan"
msgstr "Barr róscanadh"

msgctxt "#30001"
msgid "Crop away invisible edges of the screen, if the game is aware of any."
msgstr "Bearr imill dofheicthe an scáileáin, má tá a fhios ag an gcluiche go bhfuil aon cheann acu."
